  "body_html": "<h1>Mixed Strategy</h1>\n<p>A mixed strategy for player $i$ is a probability distribution over the strategy\nset \\(S_i\\). When \\(S_i\\) is finite, a mixed strategy is a vector\n\\(x_i \\in \\Delta(S_i)\\) in the standard simplex.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MSZ, Chapter 3] Maschler, Solan, and Zamir, <em>Game Theory</em>, <code>references/GameTheory.pdf</code>. Mixed strategies and mixed extensions.</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
